        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>KC2300 Tell Manufacturing Grade 2 Cylindrical Knobset\r\n</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>\r\n<br>\r\n*Certification: ANSI A156.2, Series 4000, Grade 2, (400,000 cycles), UL listed for 3 hour fire door<br>\r\n*Chassis: Cylindrical, steel - coated with zinc dichromate (corrosion resistance) <br>\r\n*Latch: 1-1/8\" x 2-1/4\", square corner faceplate, 1\" housing diameter (stainless steel), 1/2\" throw <br>\r\n*Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2 3/8\"<br>\r\n*Strike:  Square corner 1-1/4\" x 4-7/8\" ANSI ASA Strike<br>\r\n*Door Range: 1-3/8\" to 2\" <br>\r\n*Door Preparation: 2-1/8\" diameter for knob, 1\" diameter for latch bolt. Fits standard 161 door prep. <br>\r\n</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing a function:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry: Use when a keyed lock is needed.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Storeroom. Outside knob fixed. Entry by key only. Inside knob always unlocked. </li>\r\n<li>Classroom. Outside knob locked and unlocked by key. Inside knob always unlocked</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>This its is Discontinued: Use <a href=\"/products/grade-2-commercial-ball-knobset-global-svb-series\">Global SVB Series Knobs</a></b>\r\n<br><br><br>",
